Company description:
Metabolic Balance® is a holistic, preventive metabolic nutrition programme applying nature's intelligence to food dynamics and empowering changes to poor dietary habits, developed by physicians and nutritionists.

The philosophy is to help individuals into a long-term sustainable health, vitality and happiness.

We consider the individual’s unique nutritional needs when creating a nutrition plan, and ensure that all nutrient requirements are met.  

Especially through the cooperation with doctors and the support by therapists it is a product of high quality and serious approach, individual and easy to implement. 

Participants in more than 30 countries confirm that this programme works - sustainably and permanently.

Metabolic Balance®:
> personalized nutrition program; not a standard diet program;
> Based on an in-depth analysis of client's individual blood values (36), medical history personal likes & dislikes and cultural background;
> available in over 10 languages;
> 100% natural! No prescribed injections, pills, shakes or proprietary foods added;
> Patient is accompanied through the four phases by a certified coach;
> Award winning program with over 1.000.000 participants in 30 countries;
> Backed by over 25 years of scientific research by German Physicians and Nutritionists;
> Generated within 24 hours from time of request. Sent as pdf file to practitioner;
> Made in Gemany.

Metabolic Balance® is optimally suitable for:
> Medical practices;
> Therapists;
> Dieticians;
> Alternative practitioners;
> pharmacies;
> Fitness centres;
> Measures for operational health management for companies ...
